From 7bf0251b08c024ccadde43791e80a1b0a6d1a5a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arthur Heymans <arthur@aheymans.xyz>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:53:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] configs: Add QEMU q35 payload MM defconfig for CrabEFI
 (local)

Matches CrabEFI's firmware/coreboot-qemu-q35.rom.zst config, plus
payload MM: 64-bit coreboot (CrabEFI needs 64-bit SMM), SMM in TSEG
(the payload MM area needs 2 MiB of SMRAM) and a 256 KiB SMMSTORE
(crabefi-mm's store needs two halves larger than one 32 KiB variable).
OPTION_BACKEND_NONE is explicit since PAYLOAD_MM_INTERFACE otherwise
defaults to the UEFI variable store backend, which breaks the romstage
link on q35.

Signed-off-by: Arthur Heymans <arthur@aheymans.xyz>
---
 configs/defconfig.crabefi-mm | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 configs/defconfig.crabefi-mm

diff --git a/configs/defconfig.crabefi-mm b/configs/defconfig.crabefi-mm
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..796c5a839d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/configs/defconfig.crabefi-mm
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+CONFIG_OPTION_BACKEND_NONE=y
+CONFIG_CBFS_SIZE=0x00400000
+CONFIG_BOARD_EMULATION_QEMU_X86_Q35=y
+CONFIG_DRIVERS_EFI_FW_INFO=y
+CONFIG_USE_X86_64_SUPPORT=y
+CONFIG_CPU_QEMU_X86_TSEG_SMM=y
+CONFIG_DRIVERS_EFI_VARIABLE_STORE=y
+CONFIG_DRIVERS_EFI_MAIN_FW_VERSION=0x00010000
+CONFIG_DRIVERS_EFI_MAIN_FW_LSV=0x00010000
+CONFIG_DRIVERS_EFI_UPDATE_CAPSULES=y
+CONFIG_PAYLOAD_MM_INTERFACE=y
+CONFIG_SMMSTORE_SIZE=0x40000
+CONFIG_SMMSTORE=y
+CONFIG_DEFAULT_CONSOLE_LOGLEVEL_8=y
+CONFIG_PAYLOAD_NONE=y
